    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Collector history — Cloudflare Workers Analytics Engine\n\nRun history + health for the **campsite-availability collector** Cloudflare Worker (repo `robot-geographical-society`). Reads the **AE SQL API** (ClickHouse dialect) via the `campsites_ae` ClickHouse datasource. The deadline-driven CollectorLoop collects each of the **140** sites within a 2-day SLA (continuous, no fixed runs). Counts are sampling-weighted (`SUM(_sample_interval)`).\n\n- Collections/day, rate & fleet coverage: `campsite_collector` (one row per collection, `blob5`=ok/failed)\n- Step durations: `campsite_collector` `double2`\n- Top failing sites: `campsite_collector WHERE blob5='failed'`\n\n**Health & quarantine** (lower row): a failing site backs off exponentially (10m, 20m, 40m…) and after `INACTIVE_AFTER_FAILURES` consecutive failures is **quarantined** — removed from the schedule, written to the DLQ (`dlq/<id>.json` in R2), and emitted as an `inactive` state change (`blob5`). A daily probe — or `POST /collect/reactivate?id=` — emits `reactivated` and resumes it. *Failure ratio* is the system-health signal: it should sit near 0%; sustained >25% pages Discord.\n\nPanels read *No data* until the `CF_AE_TOKEN` secret (Account → Account Analytics → Read) is set and the deadline-driven CollectorLoop emits. Account `d7adee58513c1b2f770ccaac90cf114f`.\n\n**Throughput & storage**: collection rate + 30d total from `campsite_collector`; R2 stored bytes + object count from the Cloudflare GraphQL API (`r2StorageAdaptiveGroups`, bucket `campsite-raw`)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Collections (ok / failed)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "campsites_ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "campsites_ae"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "meta": {
            "timezone": "UTC"
          },
          "dateTimeColDataType": "timestamp",
          "dateTimeType": "DATETIME",
          "query": "SELECT $timeSeries AS t, SUMIf(_sample_interval, blob5='ok') AS ok, SUMIf(_sample_interval, blob5='failed') AS failed FROM campsite_collector WHERE $timeFilter GROUP BY t ORDER BY t",
          "extrapolate": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ok"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
