      "title": "Currently inactive (DLQ)",
      "description": "Quarantined sites and when they went inactive. Reactivate with POST /collect/reactivate?id=<site_id> on the backend Worker (or wait for the daily auto-probe).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
